e": "screen01.png", "id": "686837029678994", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035354_686837033012327_5993127014333897630_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LQcR8flcqpgQ7kNvwGGJG_V&_nc_oc=Ado7ws9_AOq3QQDnwbL1JJ5iueqsveC2GZURubywRTM5oKJgFOSv-_rDUgBMBtUOlXY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQZ_c76hX97udIVX774dvu3MJT-iQ4RFP5Q1yRCzw_M9w&oe=6B007825"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Meta&TAFE_Anatomy_icon_2560x1440.png", "id": "816247259438010", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001702_816247262771343_7938637194561121858_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n4VAE7AEtzEQ7kNvwERsLMc&_nc_oc=Adrd3XBjqHoNQ2ZmFbLs25i-9pUNmDSiHxmSlaPfjCrFcGMc6TCTp6NwUoyNO46aZDU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQVJofWgyd9etaUuN6TkrDBINCtTF6OWlkxlushcCdjgA&oe=6B007CD3"}, "display_name": "Animal Anatomy Explorer", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Animal Anatomy is a standalone experience that allows players to learn about animal anatomy through open exploration of an anatomically accurate, multi-layered digital replica of animals. In this initial release, two mammals will be included, a dog and a bison/buffalo.\n\nThe experience also features an interactive quiz, which assesses the player\u2019s knowledge of the anatomy of said animal. Players are given feedback on the quiz in real-time and can learn through repetition as the questions in the quiz randomize each time it is taken. ", "short_description": "Animal Anatomy is a standalone experience that allows players to learn about animal anatomy through open exploration of an anatomically accurate, multi-layered digital replica of animals. In this initial release, two mammals will be included, a dog and a bison/buffalo."}]}, "developer_name": "TAFE NSW", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.tafensw.edu.au